TY  - JOUR
T1  - Les traitements des troubles de l’attention chez l’adulte et la personne âgée
TT  - Treatment of attention disorders in younger and older adults
AN  - 918760523; 2011-23660-006
AB  - Attention is central to human cognitive functions (ou human cognitive ability). Therefore, attention disorders (ou attention deficit disorder, au choix) may severely impair everyday life. Over the last few years, several attention deficit treatments have been proposed. This review article addresses four of these intervention methods: pharmacological intervention, psychotherapeutic intervention, cognitive training as well as physical training. (PsycInfo Database Record (c) 2025 APA, all rights reserved)
 (Source: journal abstract)
