TY  - JOUR
T1  - Psychotherapie und klinisch-psychologische maßnahmen im alter
TT  - Psychotherapy and clinical psychological interventions in the elderly
AN  - 621625629; 2008-16470-002
AB  - During the last years psychotherapy and clinical psychology became more important for multi-professional treatment of old aged people and more and more therapists become specialized in this field. However, systematic literature is still lacking. One reason for this probably is a still existing "medical view" of aging and illness in the elderly. One of the aims of this paper therefore is it to detabooisate this topic and to discuss the most important contributions of psychotherapy and clinical psychology to the treatment of the elderly, especially cognitive-behavioral approaches, psychoanalytic therapy, validation and clinical psychological interventions. In addition, cognitive training, which is very useful in the treatment and prevention of dementia, is focused. (PsycInfo Database Record (c) 2025 APA, all rights reserved)
 (Source: journal abstract)
